Changes from theme-examples:
- hooks/scenes/{koi-mosaic,snow-pines,halftone,plotter-tide,deep-water,night-reef,paper-garden,honu-lagoon,
  dither-dunes,vector-range}/: rewritten. Each original CSS-animated scene is redrawn as a still SVG (still.ts)
  plus a GPU shader (shader.ts) for its moving parts.
- hooks/register.tsx: new. The theme table, picker card, commands and backdrop drawing for this plugin.
- hooks/scenes/{duck-pond,falling-sand,field-lines,garden-beetles,koi-pond,ripple-tank,sea-sparkle,semicolony}/
  scene.ts: copied, then changed so the scene fades in over its still when its shader starts: a first pass, a
  one-texel clock, notes the first frame, and the picture and the shapes drawn over it rise with it.
- The rewritten scenes' shader.ts files fade in the same way.
- hooks/scenes/koi-pond/scene.ts: while the person is waited for, the koi swim as they always do but in a band low
  around the message box, no higher than the middle of the lower-right lily pad: each follows a slow wandering
  point of its own, with a soft roof, floor and sides. Those near the box rise to the surface and open their mouths
  at it now and then. The original drew them to fixed places in a fan above the box, under the app's frosted text.
  A leaf falls every 2 seconds while something is written, not every 5.
- hooks/scenes/{classic,blueprint,braille-stars,departure-board,teletext-clouds}.ts, star-chart/ (its first frame
  is already its still), the still.ts files of the scenes above, and hooks/sounds.ts: copied unchanged.
